        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0050_brother_08",
      "hash64": "6A1E6CD8B21FBC86",
      "text": "¡Espérame, Corin![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0050_caretaker_02",
      "hash64": "359CC9D23590551E",
      "text": "¡Hola, holita, mocit[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa! Debes de ser un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa de los\\nestudiantes de la academia del extranjero, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0050_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "359CCAD2359056D1",
      "text": "Soy el encargado de varias de las instalaciones\\nque hay en esta nuestra villa. ¡Es un placer!\\c\\nYo soy la persona a la que debes acudir para\\ncualquier cosita que necesites. ¿Vale?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 180,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0050_caretaker_04",
      "hash64": "359CCBD235905884",
      "text": "Por cierto, ¿se estaban metiendo contigo esos\\nbribonzuelos?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0050_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "359CCCD235905A37",
      "text": "Ay, de verdad... Esos dos van a conseguir que\\nme dé un telele un día de estos.\\c\\nSobre todo la hermana mayor, Corin...\\nEsa niña siempre ha sido un trasto.\\c\\nTe pido disculpas si te ha causado alguna\\nmolestia.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 155,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 210,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0050_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "359CCDD235905BEA",
      "text": "¡¿Cómo, cómo?! ¿Que uno de los alumnos se\\nha indispuesto durante el viaje y están todos\\r\\nesperando en la parada del bus?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0050_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "359CCED235905D9D",
      "text": "¡Pues no me lo digas dos veces! ¡Tengo que ir\\na llevarle una medicina![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_0050_caretaker_08",
      "hash64": "359CBFD235904420",
      "text": "Tú adelántate y espéranos en el albergue\\nturístico.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_0050_caretaker_09",
      "hash64": "359CC0D2359045D3",
      "text": "¡Estaremos allí en un periquete![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_0050_caretaker_10",
      "hash64": "35A04DD235936B41",
      "text": "El camino que conduce hasta la villa tiene más\\nbaches y bultos que un Ekans harto de bayas...\\c\\n¡Como para no marearse![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
